{"id":"47fb40251ca11590","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-walsh-hadamard-code.md","title":"Walsh Hadamard Encoding","display":"df-walsh-hadamard-code — Walsh Hadamard Encoding","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-walsh-hadamard-code","aliases":["28-df-walsh-hadamard-code"],"type":"definition","display":"df-walsh-hadamard-code — Walsh Hadamard Encoding","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §19.2.2 (construction preceding Claim 19.8)","source_printed_pages":"382","source_pdf_pages":"408","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-walsh-hadamard-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-walsh-hadamard-code</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"display","html":"df-walsh-hadamard-code — Walsh Hadamard Encoding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, §19.2.2 (construction preceding Claim 19.8)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"382"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"408"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(a,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[2^n]=\\{1,\\ldots,2^n\\}\">\\([2^n]=\\{1,\\ldots,2^n\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bmod 2\">\\(\\bmod 2\\)</span> 取二元余数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\iota_n:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to[2^n],\\qquad\\iota_n(y)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i2^{n-i}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\iota_n:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to[2^n],\\qquad\\iota_n(y)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i2^{n-i}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\odot y\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i y_i\\right)\\bmod 2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\odot y\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i y_i\\right)\\bmod 2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WH}_n:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^{2^n},\\qquad\\operatorname{WH}_n(a)_{\\iota_n(y)}\\coloneqq a\\odot y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{WH}_n:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^{2^n},\\qquad\\operatorname{WH}_n(a)_{\\iota_n(y)}\\coloneqq a\\odot y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\oplus y\\coloneqq\\left\\langle(a_i+y_i)\\bmod2\\right\\rangle_{i=1}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\oplus y\\coloneqq\\left\\langle(a_i+y_i)\\bmod2\\right\\rangle_{i=1}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>§19.2.2（印刷382页/PDF408页）以模二内积的真值表编码消息。本节点把原书“规范编号”的内容落实为显式二进制序号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_n\">\\(\\iota_n\\)</span>；它是双射，故每个输出坐标恰获一个二元值，构造唯一。输出长度是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^n\">\\(2^n\\)</span>，没有把它误写为对消息长度的多项式编码。距离与两查询自纠错在下一节点分别给出形式结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"a,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"[2^n]=\\{1,\\ldots,2^n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bmod 2","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_n:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to[2^n],\\qquad\\iota_n(y)\\coloneqq1+\\sum_{i=1}^n y_i2^{n-i}.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\odot y\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i y_i\\right)\\bmod 2.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WH}_n:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^{2^n},\\qquad\\operatorname{WH}_n(a)_{\\iota_n(y)}\\coloneqq a\\odot y.","display":true},{"tex":"a\\oplus y\\coloneqq\\left\\langle(a_i+y_i)\\bmod2\\right\\rangle_{i=1}^n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\iota_n","display":false},{"tex":"2^n","display":false}],"bytes":1414,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-243","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"},{"id":"95ad6b60be2b38da","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_m^\\Sigma$ 见 [[28-df-error-correcting-code]]；$\\operatorname{WH}_n,\\iota_n,\\odot,\\oplus$ 见 [[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}